Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,A Voz Dele Quando Disse\N{\c&H00F0FF&}“Mas Você Vende Para Fazendeiros.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ele ia perder no Shark Tank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,por causa dos seus princípios…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,até que isso aconteceu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Por que não 7 dólares?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nunca fiz isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sempre tentei fazer o certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ganho um dólar em cada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Não posso entrar com você,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,não tem margem pra mim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,como distribuidor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Preciso vender por 12 dólares
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,pra eu ter algum lucro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,e você também.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:21.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00F0FF&}Mas você vende para fazendeiros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Entendi, só estou vendo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,o que você pensa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quem vai pagar isso, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quem vai pagar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Estou fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sim, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fazendeiros são a base dos EUA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Muitos fazendeiros por aí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,não pagam 12 dólares por árvore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Talvez paguem 6 ou 7 dólares.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vou te dar tudo que pediu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,150 mil dólares por 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,O que você faz é certo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:52.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,e merece a chance de crescer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,e fazer muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quero ser seu sócio, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gosto de tudo que você defende.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, parceiro.
